 "project": {
  "listPage": "index.html",
  "list": "projects",
  "card": "\t\t\t\t\t\t<article class=\"style{{n}}\" data-se-type=\"project\" data-se-date=\"{{date}}\" data-se-github=\"{{github}}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"image\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"{{image}}\" alt=\"{{title}}\" />\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"{{page}}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"date\">{{date}}</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>{{title}}</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>{{text}}</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</article>\n",
  "page": "\t\t\t\t\t<section data-se=\"section blocks\" data-se-role=\"project\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h1>{{title}}</h1>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>{{text}}</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"image main\"><img src=\"{{image}}\" alt=\"{{title}}\" /></span>\n<!--se:if github-->\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"actions\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"{{github}}\" class=\"button primary icon brands fa-github\">Code on GitHub</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n<!--/se:if-->\t\t\t\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"post\" data-se=\"section blocks\" data-se-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>First blog post</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"date\">{{date}}</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>What you did, what worked and what did not. Click this text to change it. Use + New blog post to add the next one: the newest post goes on top, and its date becomes the date on the project's tile on the home page.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\n",
  "post": "\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"post\" data-se=\"section blocks\" data-se-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>{{title}}</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"date\">{{date}}</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Write your blog post here: what you did, what worked and what did not.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\n"
 },
 "starters": {
  "home": "index.html",
  "page": "about.html"
